{"id":"gandhari-tmdb-1355228","type":"MOVIE","category":"STREAMING","title":"Gandhari","overview":"Tras el secuestro de su pequeña hija y un brutal ataque que la deja temporalmente ciega, Bani se embarca en una desesperada búsqueda para encontrarla. Siguiendo las pistas hasta la misteriosa localidad de Joypurra, descubre una peligrosa red de trata de menores. Sin dejar que la pérdida de la vista la detenga, Bani se convierte en una fuerza implacable dispuesta a enfrentarse a cualquiera que se interponga entre ella y su hija.","releaseDate":"2026-09-04","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCHei97aPYCCsh4vicz9X0wmdFV.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sT5WVT8LzvDwIbfy9BGXK0fvf3s.jpg","genres":["Acción","Drama","Suspense"],"originalLanguage":"hi","spokenLanguages":["Hindi"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/sT5WVT8LzvDwIbfy9BGXK0fvf3s.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7CpkNz9r3R0ZxsqCg3mdZ5ahnMJ.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3z33uIftqBlaZSiAastdmUbo6Le.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3KKpZKwiGfEOvZJyuINc2HrolCx.jpg","label":"Escena 04"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":7.383},"availability":{"platforms":["Netflix","Netflix Standard with Ads"]},"cast":[{"name":"Taapsee Pannu","role":"Bani Sikdar","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/43e24aeOC8AZITo6ShaKKG9aV0Y.jpg","personTmdbId":550167,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Ishwak Singh","role":"Gokul Sikdar","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iN1QUGzN7c4qBps3xpuWYVzpMag.jpg","personTmdbId":1424750,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Mita Vashisht","role":"Jhunu Amba","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mcnaQTCmuz3lXNotFFdkwCO7FTY.jpg","personTmdbId":1140663,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"Swastika Mukherjee","role":"Miss Churni","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjEdXwco3KjWU7zFDhJgMJYmerh.jpg","personTmdbId":1144344,"department":"Acting"},{"name":"छाया कदम","rol